# PyPI publish token for the gamentic engine wheel (tool-gamentic-engine-7h8aweky).
#
# 1. Copy this file to `.env.publish` (that name is gitignored, so the token never
#    gets committed):   cp .env.publish.example .env.publish
# 2. Create a token at https://pypi.org/manage/account/token/ (scope it to the
#    project `tool-gamentic-engine-7h8aweky` once it exists, or an account-wide
#    token for the first upload) and paste it below in `.env.publish`.
# 3. The publish step in docs/RELEASE.md loads it:
#      set -a; . ../.env.publish; set +a
#      uv publish --token "$PYPI_TOKEN" dist/*<version>*
#
# This is the ONLY secret needed to ship: the Anna executa/app publish uses the saved
# CLI PAT (~/.config/anna/credentials.json), not this token.
PYPI_TOKEN=pypi-REPLACE_ME_WITH_YOUR_REAL_TOKEN
